  ],
  "description": "The Lung Image Database Consortium (LIDC-IDRI) image collection consists of diagnostic and lung cancer screening thoracic CT scans with marked-up annotated lesions. It is a web-accessible international resource for development, training, and evaluation of computer-assisted diagnostic (CAD) methods for lung cancer detection and diagnosis. Please see the LIDC-IDRI page to learn more about the images and to obtain any supporting metadata for this collection.",
